{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17834","headline":"和杜中丞西禅院看花 · 杨巨源","name":"和杜中丞西禅院看花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一林堆锦映千灯，照眼牵情欲不胜。\n知倚晴明娇自足，解将颜色醉相仍。\n好风轻引香烟入，甘露才和粉艳凝。\n深处最怜莺蹂践，嬾时先被蝶侵凌。\n对持真境应无取，分付空门又未能。\n迎日似翻红烧断，临流疑映绮霞层。\n幽含晚态怜丹桂，盛绩春光识紫藤。\n每到花枝独惆怅，山东惟有杜中丞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}